{"product_id":"magonia","title":"Magonia","description":"\u003cp\u003eAza Ray is drowning in thin air. Since she was a baby, Aza has suffered from a mysterious lung disease that makes it ever harder for her to breathe, to speak—to live.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eSo when Aza catches a glimpse of a ship in the sky, her family chalks it up to a cruel side effect of her medication. But Aza doesn’t think this is a hallucination. She can hear someone on the ship calling her name.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eOnly her best friend, Jason, listens. Jason, who’s always been there. Jason, for whom she might have more-than-friendly feelings. But before Aza can consider that thrilling idea, something goes terribly wrong. Aza is lost to our world—and found by another.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eMagonia.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eAbove the clouds, in a land of trading ships, Aza is not the weak and dying thing she was. In Magonia, she can breathe for the first time—better, she has immense power. As she navigates her new life, she discovers that war is coming. Magonia and Earth are on the cusp of a reckoning, and in Aza’s hands lies the fate of the whole of humanity—including the boy who loves her. Where do her loyalties lie?\u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:20 x 229  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Maria Dahvana Headley \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780062391674 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Trade Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 320\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44783477358745,"sku":"8RF9780062391674","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/cf1e5513d71f0753aff1603ee2e18816.jpg?v=1724774719","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/magonia","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}